From f864ab623e4ccdd3b2e0c37786c02c55ee5ff19c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emir Turkes <eturkes@bu.edu>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 09:49:09 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] codex/claude: keep ToolSearch discoveries at reference
 position

Declare referenced deferred tools via additional_tools to preserve the cached prompt prefix. Keep upstream system-message tool additions and compatibility endpoints intact.
